!!Asycnchronous Processing

----
!!OFX - Getting and Posting

((OFX is a wrapper that makes calling services as easy as possible. It currently includes making get and post calls to the server.))

{{{
OFX.get("path to my service")
// or
OFX.post("path to my service")
  .withAction("myAction") //Optional
  .withData({name: "myName"}) //Optional
  .onSuccess( //Optional
	function(response) {
		//process the response
	}
	)
  .onSuccess( //Optional
	function(response) {
		//process the response
	}
	)
  .onError( //Optional
	function(response) {
		//process the response
	}
	)
  .go();
}}}

